00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:45.450
got to get it right, keep it rolling.

00:07:47.032 --> 00:07:49.692
I think this is a great country,

00:07:49.692 --> 00:07:52.780
and I think it's the greatest
country in the world,

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:56.947
and I think that all this
will get worked out, and ...

00:07:58.106 --> 00:08:00.922
I'm an optimistic person,
I'm not, you know ...

00:08:00.922 --> 00:08:03.172
