00:09:16.758 --> 00:09:18.528
the audience kind of picks up with it.

00:09:18.528 --> 00:09:19.775
And I think that's why ...

00:09:19.775 --> 00:09:21.306
- 'Cause you can take
material that ordinarily

00:09:21.306 --> 00:09:22.693
wouldn't be funny if somebody else did it,

00:09:22.693 --> 00:09:23.790
